											(b) dass die mit den Werten verbundene Unsicherheit größer oder gleich der CMC-Unsicherheit ist.</dcc:content>
					<dcc:content lang="en">All measurement results are accompanied by a dcc:valid (or dcc:validXMLList) element 
											with a refId pointing to this dcc:statement element. 
											Entries "true" within this dcc:valid (or dcc:validXMLList) element denote that 
											(a) the associated result(s) is/are within the accredited (or KCDB-covered) range AND 
											(b) that the uncertainty associated with the value(s) is greater than or equal to the CMC uncertainty.</dcc:content>
				</dcc:description>
				<dcc:link>https://bipm.example/kcdb/cmc/CH-EM-0042</dcc:link>
				<dcc:declaration>
					<dcc:content lang="en">The issuing institute is a signatory of the CIPM Mutual Recognition Arrangement, and this calibration falls within the calibration and measurement capability CH-EM-0042 published in the key comparison database. Every organisation named in this document is fictional.</dcc:content>
